<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref} from 'vue';
type Row=Record<string,any>;
const props=defineProps<{token:string;keys:Row[]}>();
const emit=defineEmits<{changed:[]}>();
const id=ref(''),secret=ref(''),ips=ref(''),enabled=ref(true),busy=ref(false),error=ref(''),notice=ref('');
function select(){const key=props.keys.find(k=>k.id===id.value);enabled.value=!!key?.access_enabled;secret.value='';ips.value=''}
async function save(){busy.value=true;error.value='';notice.value='';try{const r=await fetch('/api/v1/manage/keys/access',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json',Authorization:'Bearer '+props.token},body:JSON.stringify({id:id.value,enabled:enabled.value,secret:secret.value,safe_ips:ips.value.split(/[\s,]+/).filter(Boolean)})});const p=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(p.message||'保存失败');secret.value='';notice.value=enabled.value?'已启用开放接口，旧AccessKey已撤销。secretKey只保存摘要。':'已关闭开放接口并撤销AccessKey。';emit('changed')}catch(e){error.value=String(e)}finally{busy.value=false}}
</script>
<template><article class="panel"><details><summary>PushPlus 消息查询与删除</summary><p>先启用并设置secretKey，再通过 getAccessKey 获取两小时有效的AccessKey。查询仅能访问此凭证发送的消息；删除不撤回手机已有通知。</p><form @submit.prevent="save"><label>PushPlus凭证<select v-model="id" @change="select" required><option value="" disabled>选择凭证</option><option v-for="k in keys.filter(k=>k.kind==='pushplus'&&!k.disabled)" :key="k.id" :value="k.id">{{k.label}} · {{k.access_enabled?'已启用':'未启用'}}</option></select></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" v-model="enabled">启用开放接口</label><template v-if="enabled"><label>新的secretKey<input v-model="secret" type="password" minlength="32" maxlength="256" required autocomplete="new-password"><small>32–256字节。修改配置会撤销所有旧AccessKey。</small></label><label>安全IP/CIDR（可选）<textarea v-model="ips" placeholder="每行一个IP或CIDR"/><small>检查Gateway直连对端地址，不信任外部X-Forwarded-For。NPM/Cloudflare后的客户端IP限制应在代理侧配置；留空只使用双重凭证验证。</small></label></template><button class="primary" :disabled="busy||!id">{{busy?'保存中…':'保存开放接口设置'}}</button><p v-if="error" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</p><p v-if="notice" class="success" role="status">{{notice}}</p></form><code>POST /api/common/openApi/getAccessKey</code><p>JSON参数：token、secretKey。后续消息接口在Header中传access-key。</p><code>POST /api/open/message/list</code><p>分页参数current、pageSize（最大50）。</p><code>GET /api/open/message/sendMessageResult?shortCode=UUID</code><p>返回服务器处理状态和实际APP接收设备数。</p><code>DELETE /api/open/message/deleteMessage?shortCode=UUID</code><p>隐藏本凭证消息与落地页，保留服务器审计记录。</p></details></article></template>
